enus: lay down the user-fixed pronunciations

open/produce/quality with corrected phones. address and visual were tried
and put back: the dictionary carries no stress operator, so emphasis is
the rules business, not the words.
dict.py build laid them down: new constant-blob records plus the rule
arms repointed at them. dict.py read its own work back word for word.
Applied at build time so CI builds the same tree.
